<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Logistics of Large-Scale Domestic Vehicle Transport
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee zero scratches during long‑distance vehicle transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a proprietary seven‑layer protection system that combines high‑density foam edge guards, 80‑GSM bubble wrap, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for fragile components. Each vehicle is secured on hydraulic ramp trailers with anti‑scratch rubber pads, and our drivers follow a strict no‑contact loading protocol, ensuring a scratch‑free journey from Delhi to Mumbai.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What advantages do hydraulic ramp trailers offer over traditional open carriers for large‑scale domestic vehicle transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers provide a smooth, motor‑driven loading slope that eliminates manual lifting, reducing the risk of dents and alignment issues. Their enclosed bodies protect against dust, rain, and road debris, while built‑in wheel chocks and ratchet lashings keep vehicles immobile. This technology aligns perfectly with our zero‑scratch guarantee on the Delhi‑Mumbai corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I monitor my vehicle’s location in real time while it travels from Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every trailer in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS units that feed live coordinates to our 24/7 control center. Customers receive a secure link to view the vehicle’s progress on an interactive map, receive automated status alerts at key milestones, and can contact our support team instantly for any queries.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for inter‑state vehicle transport in India?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The essential documents include a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued identity proof of the owner, a signed transport agreement, and an e‑Way bill generated through the GST portal. For corporate or government moves, additional clearance letters may be needed. Our team assists in preparing and filing each document to ensure seamless transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are the costs for large‑scale vehicle relocation between Delhi and Mumbai calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on vehicle size, weight, and the number of units per trailer, combined with distance‑based fuel surcharges, toll fees, and any special handling requirements such as extra padding or climate‑controlled containers. We also factor in insurance coverage and real‑time traffic conditions, providing a transparent, itemized quote before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the service, and what does it cover for domestic vehicle transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that safeguards against accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards. The policy offers 100 % declared‑value coverage, meaning the full market value of your vehicle is protected throughout the Delhi‑Mumbai journey. Optional higher‑value add‑ons are available on request.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad handle loading and unloading at both origin and destination points?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained loading crew uses hydraulic ramps to glide the vehicle onto the trailer, securing it with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and wheel chocks. At the destination, the same crew operates the ramp in reverse, ensuring a smooth, damage‑free unload. Each step is documented with photos and a signed handover report for full accountability.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
